  "content": "<div>\n  <p>To determine your version of Excel, and whether it's 32-bit or 64-bit:</p><ol><li><p>Open Excel</p></li><li><p>File &gt; Account &gt; About Excel</p></li><li><p>The version will be displayed at the top of the open dialog box</p></li></ol>\n</div>\n\n<figure><img src=\"/images/docs/15475960_image.png\" alt=\"image.png\" /></figure>",
